{
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In twenty thirteen, a brand new London skyscraper melted a car parked across the street.",
   "start": 0.05
  },
  {
   "text": "It's late summer, and London's newest tower is a giant of shiny glass that gets wider as it goes up.",
   "start": 4.711
  },
  {
   "text": "Its whole south side curves inward, like a huge glass bowl tipped toward the street.",
   "start": 10.011
  },
  {
   "text": "One sunny afternoon, a man parks his shiny black car right underneath it.",
   "start": 14.234
  },
  {
   "text": "He comes back a couple of hours later, and his wing mirror is drooping like a candle.",
   "start": 18.189
  },
  {
   "text": "The badge has melted, and the panels have gone all wavy.",
   "start": 22.182
  },
  {
   "text": "Down the street, a shop's doormat is scorched, and bike seats are going soft.",
   "start": 25.045
  },
  {
   "text": "So a reporter takes a frying pan outside, cracks an egg on the pavement, and it sizzles.",
   "start": 28.778
  },
  {
   "text": "Spot readings on that street hit a hundred and seventeen degrees.",
   "start": 33.362
  },
  {
   "text": "Luckily, London is famous for cloudy weather.",
   "start": 36.518
  },
  {
   "text": "Unluckily, that week, the sun showed up.",
   "start": 38.715
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, a flat window bounces sunlight back and spreads it out.",
   "start": 40.597
  },
  {
   "text": "But a window curved inward bounces it all toward the same small spot.",
   "start": 43.668
  },
  {
   "text": "Ever burned a leaf with a magnifying glass? Same idea, except this magnifying glass is a hundred and sixty metres tall.",
   "start": 46.989
  },
  {
   "text": "The owners paid for the car repairs, then bolted a giant sunshade of metal fins across the glass.",
   "start": 54.043
  },
  {
   "text": "Two years later, it was voted the worst new building in Britain.",
   "start": 59.553
  },
  {
   "text": "And the architect? His curved hotel in Las Vegas had been singeing sunbathers' hair by the pool, three years earlier.",
   "start": 62.574
  }
 ],
